# TEST muhit (staging) build config: `npm run build:staging` (= `vite build --mode staging`).
# Sayt: https://test-admin.elchipochta.uz (Worker `elchi-frontend-test`, wrangler.jsonc → env.staging).
# NOTE: all VITE_* values are embedded into the client bundle and are therefore PUBLIC. Never put secrets here.
# VITE_APP_ENV=staging — «TEST muhit» belgisi, noindex, sarlavha prefiksi, CSP'da test API hosti (vite.config.ts →
# scripts/staging-build.mjs).
# Bir domenli API (same-origin): ilova API'ga `https://test-admin.elchipochta.uz/api/*` orqali murojaat qiladi — CORS
# preflight yo'q. `/api/*` va `/socket.io/*` ni Worker (`worker/index.ts`) `wrangler.jsonc` → `env.staging.vars.API_ORIGIN`
# ga proksi qiladi. VITE_BASE_URL nisbiy bo'lsa faqat `/api/` (boshqasi — build yiqiladi).
# VITE_PUBLIC_API_URL — API hostining o'zi (https, production emas): tashqi havolalar (Carrier API), CSP (img/media).
# Orqaga qaytish (to'g'ridan-to'g'ri API): VITE_BASE_URL=https://test-api.elchipochta.uz/ — Elchi-Backend
# docs/ops/same-origin-api.md §4.
VITE_BASE_URL=/api/
VITE_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://test-api.elchipochta.uz/
VITE_APP_ENV=staging
VITE_DEBUG=false
